		(property "Design notes" "Single isolated output, NOT the dual-output part. 1 W, 5 V / 200 mA; 4.5 to 9 V at module input pins. Pins 3 and 5 are absent. Two independent output pairs are series-connected only at this channel MID. MID terminal is passive for ERC because it is the selected output reference. Body 17 x 7.62 x 11 mm; pin locations 0, 2.54, 7.62, 12.70 mm. Bench design, not a medical isolation certification."
